        "metadata": {
          "layer": "domain",
          "provenance": "curated",
          "description": "模型/实体管理服务（loc=1317，全仓最大服务）：模型标签映射、厂商分组、实体 CRUD、聚类/合并/派生、AI 建议标签。\n关键契约：经 services 桶导出；扇入主要来自 routers.tags/routers.admin_entities；跨 service 调用走 services 包内依赖。",
          "depth": "detailed"
        }
      },
      "models": {
        "label": "ORM 模型",
        "metadata": {
          "layer": "domain",
          "provenance": "curated",
          "description": "SQLAlchemy ORM 实体全集：User/Tag/TagKey/Demo/DemoTag/Comment/SessionLog/DemoTimeline/Setting/VisitDaily/Acknowledgment/DemoRating/Announcement 等，全站数据契约的唯一真源（fan_in=41 耦合中心）。\n关键契约：demos.updated_at 禁止 onupdate（版本化预览 URL 依赖其精确性，曾致 CDN 缓存失效事故）；Demo 含幂等键 idempotency_key 与内容哈希 content_hash 双去重；v2 起 Run 元数据收编为列（gen_rounds/gen_minutes/gen_platform）。\n领域概念：demo_type(web/zip/link)、评分冗余列(rating_avg/god/ghost)、多站可见域(sites)、标签三态状态机(candidate/active/deprecated)。",
          "depth": "deep"
        }
      },
      "schemas": {
        "label": "Pydantic 模型",
        "metadata": {
          "layer": "domain",
          "provenance": "curated",
          "description": "Pydantic 请求/响应模型全集（fan_in=20，loc=894）：认证/标签/Demo/论坛/评分/设置等所有接口的入参出参定义。\n关键契约：上传类含幂等键校验、标签键模式(fixed/open/int)校验、分页 Paginated 泛型。",
          "depth": "detailed"
        }
      },
